L118: 目标值:
L119: - 简单GEMM: > 80% (CUTLASS benchmark)
L120: - FlashAttention: 60-70% (有softmax overhead)
L121: - TE Linear (FP8): > 75%
L122: - MoE grouped GEMM: 50-65% (小矩阵)
L124: 如果TC < 50%:
L125: 检查1: tile size是否太小 (TC under-utilized per instruction)
L126: 检查2: K-loop是否有unnecessary sync
L127: 检查3: epilogue是否太重 (compute在non-TC pipe上)
    L130: 4.2 Pipeline效率
