L162: 与理论峰值(3.35 TB/s)比较
L164: 理想情况:
L165: Bandwidth-limited kernel: > 80% peak
L166: 如果 < 60%:
L167: 1. Non-coalesced access → 检查access pattern
L168: 2. Small transfers → 检查vectorization
L169: 3. Page faults → 检查unified memory usage
    L172: 5.2 Cache效率
L175: L2 hit rate:
L181: GEMM: 通常 30-50% (tile reuse)
L182: Elementwise: 接近0% (streaming, no reuse)
L183: 小tensor操作: > 80% (fit in L2)
